One for you. Cool, thanks.

83
00:03:49,147 --> 00:03:50,356
And one for you.

84
00:03:50,481 --> 00:03:51,733
Cool, thanks.

85
00:03:51,816 --> 00:03:55,194
Oh! You missed your head. There you go.

86
00:03:55,486 --> 00:03:56,571
Phyllis, think fast!

87
00:03:58,489 --> 00:04:01,367
All right, guys, a little foreplay before we do it.

88
00:04:01,659 --> 00:04:05,747
Fans of Ken Burns' Jazz will most certainly enjoy The Civil War.

89
