109
00:05:01,344 --> 00:05:04,305
Robert, you've got your sheep, and you got your black sheep.

110
00:05:04,389 --> 00:05:07,100
And I'm not even a sheep. I am on the freaking moon.

111
00:05:09,394 --> 00:05:11,229
So, here's what we can do.

112
00:05:11,938 --> 00:05:12,939
Game changers.

113
00:05:13,481 --> 00:05:15,817
Changes to the game, such that the game

114
00:05:15,942 --> 00:05:18,319
