162
00:07:38,209 --> 00:07:39,168
He's a historian.

163
00:07:39,252 --> 00:07:42,547
Gettysburg was very important. Credit where credit is due, okay?

164
00:07:42,630 --> 00:07:45,049
Big mad props to Gettysburg.

165
00:07:45,133 --> 00:07:48,553
Was it, however, the most northern battle of the Civil War?

166
00:07:48,928 --> 00:07:50,096
Yes, yes... Not by a long shot!

167
00:07:50,179 --> 00:07:51,139
Yes! No!

168
00:07:51,264 --> 00:07:54,308
No, it was not! No, it was not!

169
00:07:54,392 --> 00:07:56,060
Was it the second most northern?

170
00:07:56,144 --> 00:07:57,395
What?

171
00:07:57,478 --> 00:08:00,148
Sure! I would cede it was the second most northern battle...

172
00:08:00,231 --> 00:08:01,274
Erin!

173
00:08:01,357 --> 00:08:03,317
Was it the northernmost? No! Get out of here, Oscar...

174
00:08:03,401 --> 00:08:04,402
Get out of here!

175
00:08:04,610 --> 00:08:10,241
I am so eager to hear your game changers. Let's dig in, shall we?

176
00:08:10,408 --> 00:08:12,326
May I go first? Absolutely.

177
00:08:15,204 --> 00:08:18,291
Raw fish.The disgusting food from Japan

178
00:08:18,374 --> 00:08:20,042
